# One day in 6/4 — the conductor life scheduler.
#
# Mapping:
#   - 1 quarter note = 4 hours
#   - Full bar (6 quarters) = 24 hours
#   - 1 demisemiquaver (32nd) = 30 minutes
#
# The third beat below contains a "second sleep" texture: a quarter
# subdivided into eight 32nd-notes alternating wake/sleep at 30-minute
# resolution.

time_signature 6/4
quarter_duration 4h

| sleep:q | sleep:q | sleep:q[wake:t,sleep:t,wake:t,sleep:t,wake:t,sleep:t,wake:t,sleep:t] | wake:q | work:q | rest:q |
